@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to assign a train to a route
    activate System

    System --> Employee : shows the list of available scenarios
    deactivate

    Employee -> System : selects a scenario
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows available locomotives for the assignment
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a locomotive
    activate System

    loop selecting the route's stations

    System --> Employee : shows existing stations
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a station to add to the route
    activate System

    end loop

    System --> Employee: checks if there are railways between all selected stations \n and shows the available cargo to be picked up
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System: selects the wanted cargo to be picked up
    activate System

    System --> Employee: shows all data for confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms all data
    activate System

    System --> Employee : creates the route and displays success
    deactivate System
@enduml
